# models/
#
# This folder will contain Dart model classes for QueueLess entities.
#
# Planned models (to be added in later milestones):
#   - queue_token.dart   → QueueToken model (toMap / fromMap for SQLite)
#   - appointment.dart   → Appointment model
#   - service.dart       → Service model (e.g. "Bank Counter", "Hospital OPD")
#   - user.dart          → User model (basic profile)
#
# Each model will implement:
#   - A named constructor
#   - toMap()   → converts the object to a Map<String, dynamic> for SQLite
#   - fromMap() → factory constructor that creates an object from a SQLite row
